	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tuas accepi, honorande compater, et quia interea <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>te meas quoque accepisse puto, non est opus, ut illis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nunc plura addam, nec possum etiam propter varias <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>occupationes et maturum nuncii abitum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>De <persName ref="p3241">Trempii</persName> rebus <persName>Kienerus</persName> ad <persName ref="p7228">Zvinglium</persName>, generum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tuum, scribit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Obiit intestatus, ut audio, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>et ante ipsum quoque uxor eius similiter; impedivit ipse<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>met uxorem, ne testamentum conderet, postea impe<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ditus fuit ipse ab haeredibus, qui tanquam <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>harpyę (ut prius aliquoties quoque me ad te s<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>cripsisse memini) aut vultures semimortuo cadaveri asseder<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>unt impatienter exhalationem animę eius expectantes.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Fecerunt suis moribus, ut animadverterem meum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>accessum illis esse suspectum, ideoque minus frequenter <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>postremo hoc tempore ipsum conveni.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Es sind ett<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>lich fründ uß dem <placeName ref="l1664">Turtal</placeName> herin bschickt worden; <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>deren sind 3 hie.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Ich weiß aber nitt, was inen <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>wirt.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Ich hör, es werde nieman nüt dann <persName>Batsche<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>lers</persName> tochter, die er erzogen, 100 lib.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Guͦts ist sonst <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>vil da.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Er hatt zuͦ vil klünglet; deß kumpt sin guͦt <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>dahin, da man i<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>mm sin nitt vil danck wirt wüßen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Si habend die alt jungfraw ußbißen, damitt si dest <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>bas hüten köntind, auch wider sin eigen willen.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quę <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nova habeo, ad fratrem scripsi; is tibi ea communicabit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Foedus <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>illud <placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudicum</placeName> proxime remittam.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta totam domum tuam et <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>d. <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName>, cui nunc rescribere<note type="misc">rescriberem</note> non possum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> 4. martii 61.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">Hall[erus]</persName> tuus.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrych<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>o Bullingero</persName>, domino <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>honorando e<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>t compatri charissimo.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
